#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:7
#: 8f4ba552b1364bd499b0491f2ac20a1a
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:9
#: e501e3300f454081a49fc4fd587002be
msgid ""
"在体相或表面结构中随机插入额外原子。支持 Interstitial（体相间隙位插入）和 "
"Adsorption（表面吸附位放置）两种模式，用最小距离约束避免原子碰撞。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:11
#: 363f2376f3254ca7a8c82ba41b58d8d8
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:13
#: e38d1e60696d4bc9b606086cb2bb82ce
msgid "场景：模型对 Li 扩散路径预测完全错误"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:15
#: 63135b2a9455401cbd783b75d72d34a2
msgid ""
"你在 LiCoO2 上训练了一个 NEP 模型跑 Li 扩散。模型预测的扩散势垒比 DFT "
"低了一半——中间态的能量被严重低估。检查训练集发现：所有结构里 Li 都待在八面体位点，从来没见过 Li 在四面体间隙位的结构。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:17
#: 75a75508aa454c7699fd36616bbdcdba
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 扩散路径上的过渡态对应 Li "
"从一个八面体位穿过四面体间隙位跃迁到相邻八面体位的过程。训练集里只有基态构型，模型自然会低估中间态能量。需要往训练集里加入 Li "
"在四面体间隙位附近的构型，让模型见过这些局域环境。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:19
#: 8ff08ca20e8e404c91e671575c865da5
msgid "**输入：** 一个 LiCoO2 超胞"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:21
#: 30ed97d64b6a45c3934f33d2b967cf9b
msgid "**目标：** 在体相中插入单个 Li 原子于随机间隙位，生成 50 个候选构型"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:23
#: 87d1aad804d24d2e92e5c7320bac9658
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:24
#: 3ec03575c1774f36b4c670909748f39a
msgid "`Mode` = `Interstitial`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:25
#: e86f6a9dfe584ef7a18f8f49a02d6f07
msgid "`Species comma-separated` = `Li`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:26
