#: e458d577810942a1b235011d2cc163d8
msgid "`Min distance (A)` = `[1.4]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:29
#: 569a2ff4f155441eb371e22e5d347d7f
msgid "`Max Attempts` = `[200]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:31
#: 85f243d53c6b4ca084c88729e11b3f75
msgid "**输出：** 50 个插隙结构，每个含一个额外 Li 原子放置于不与宿主原子碰撞的位置，带 `Ins(int,n=1)` 标签"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:33
#: 09de9f5f1b004e4d9b4ba158a1ad9ae5
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:34
#: a68f9c43b44e4640b8e678668f5b2c37
msgid "重训后用 NEB 算 Li 扩散势垒，应接近 DFT 参考值"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:35
#: 9a0c36509ee14ba285dfc1075125bb0e
msgid "抽查插入原子的最近邻距离：≥ min_distance 是底线，太近（<1.0 Å）的结构应该不会出现"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:36
#: 91eff818a2d148229bdf465f33831b53
msgid "如果成功率很低（输出远少于 50 个），增大 `max_attempts` 或降低 `min_distance`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:37
#: 18ea9b0471364020b6c0ff949e2a6d08
msgid "如果是表面吸附场景，切到 `Mode` = `Adsorption`，调整 `offset` 控制吸附高度"
msgstr ""

