msgid "插入物种与宿主剧烈反应（如碱金属+水）→ 先确认化学可行性"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:50
#: 62b1beb0276b4856aee0bd9536809a18
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:52
#: ad10f530ffcc4245bde2587c98b827ef
msgid "插入模式和数量"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:54
#: 8584475dcf8641d3a7c10600b96d752b
msgid "Mode（mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:56
#: 60b3d3b1f2534a99ad0773eb8222c8d7
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 0。`0` = Interstitial（体相插隙），在晶胞内随机采样位点放入额外原子；`1` = "
"Adsorption（表面吸附），沿表面法向在表面上方放置原子。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:58
#: dc7c261c29844237af630dea8fa7ab3f
msgid ""
"Interstitial 模式下 `axis` 和 `offset` 不生效。Adsorption 模式需要 slab 输入，`axis` "
"决定了吸附原子沿哪条晶轴放。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:60
#: 818071e4835441c39503c9a3a891c824
msgid "Species（species）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:62
#: 9b31d8ba97d04aca85cbcdf5b74c1790
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。逗号分隔的元素列表，指定要插入什么原子。支持权重写法：`Li:0.7,Na:0.3` 表示每次随机放置时有 70% 概率插 "
"Li，30% 概率插 Na。权重不写则等概率。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:64
#: 2040e860557f4ce2821ffa37710725cd
msgid "Insert Count（insert_count）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:66
#: 688338c082e947cd9e2235357f34e9d4
msgid "`int`，默认 1。每个生成结构里插几个额外原子。1~3 是常见范围——单原子插隙最容易放进去，数量越大碰撞失败概率越高。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:68
#: 91e9c79d56514763b4717ed15f94f06b
msgid "Structure Count（structure_count）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:70
#: 338fbe2b904a4cacbb1106c51a3f9f7e
msgid "`int`，默认 10。每输入帧生成多少个插入版本。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:72
#: 1e2aa82dcef546e9b61a50ce08b052bc
msgid "10~50 做轻量验证，50~200 常规覆盖，200 以上建议接 `FPS Filter`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:74
#: 9aa638c800e24fcda03aa82c5a9e9899
msgid "几何约束"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:76
#: 3a01d193afac43808703d941c516162b
msgid "Min Distance（min_distance）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:78
#: 8ec1104b8a7844eb89cb8f46bbb7a79a
msgid "`float`，默认 1.4。候选插入点与已有原子的最小允许距离，单位 Å。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:80
#: 5b7b90256eb54d598cfe375ae06ff6fc
msgid ""
"对致密晶体，1.6~2.5 Å 比较保守安全；1.2~1.6 Å 是一个平衡点；压到 0.8~1.2 Å "
"碰撞风险明显升高，只有在你确信结构能容纳时才用。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:82
#: ce0b0d7ff1424197aea83fdb01feb1ad
msgid "Max Attempts（max_attempts）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:84
#: 7aeacffa873041339a3c20ff9516aef0
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 200。每个待插入原子的最大随机尝试次数。增大它可以提高放置成功率，但耗时线性增长——如果你发现 200 "
"次几乎每次都触顶失败，说明问题不是尝试次数不够，而是 `min_distance` 设大了或者胞太密。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:86
#: 3934ad449956474c981f2a4d6f26d8ba
msgid "表面吸附"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:88
#: a27d797b68b4436392f799b7bb776ee4
msgid "Axis（axis）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:90
#: 2b0539c3d4ed4dafa40b1e452a2ad8dc
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 2。Adsorption 模式下它是表面法向。如果你的 slab 真空沿 z，默认 2（z "
"轴）就不用改；表面取向不同时一定要调，否则吸附高度方向会错。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:92
#: 769ddb7c83264a2f850ffd2bc4d83664
msgid "生效条件：涉及方向、分层、表面或向量初始化的模式都会使用。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:94
#: 226acf7e838e4f968016669706d5be82
msgid "Offset（offset）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:96
#: fb0a9d818ab04b0c92cad5b1452509ed
msgid "`float`，默认 1.5。表面吸附时原子放在表面上方多远，单位 Å。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:98
#: 9e406890a1004f7bbae5dc6ee39d2af4
msgid "生效条件：`mode` 选择 Adsorption 时。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:100
#: 847c8facb9074b78b501fa5aeaf4ae13
msgid "随机性"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:102
#: 99cea4d8d07747eebc7c22b4ec0232f5
msgid "Use Seed（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:104
#: 33e1d1d8254145cebf56cccb6005c9d0
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后固定 seed → 同样输入和参数每次跑出一样的插入结果。对比实验时开，纯探索可以关掉。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:106
#: 09effa8808af497e9a916ceaf4e093dd
msgid "Seed（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:108
#: 4984ce76d06346d2a01a2f047522dab1
msgid "`int`，默认 0。随机种子值。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:110
#: 2f7d4431fc084806882c21db283a32a7
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr ""

