msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:176
#: 3ce71c46006d42298d14aa3181c3f8fa
msgid ""
"**输出为空或数量远少于预期。** `min_distance` 太严、`max_attempts` 太小，或者输入超胞太密找不到合适位点。先放宽"
" min_distance 到 1.0 Å 试跑。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:178
#: 60c6e27b84924c178d8107fde5664390
msgid ""
"**插入原子和宿主重叠。** 检查 min_distance 是否 ≤ 0（被跳过）。如果 min_distance 合理但仍重叠，增大 "
"`max_attempts`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:180
#: 302d5248f9ed4a1cbeb2cc4c21590c67
msgid ""
"**Adsorption 模式下原子放在 box 外面。** 检查 axis 是否指向了正确的表面法向。如果 slab 的 c "
"轴不是表面法向，需要调整 axis。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:182
#: 7f25bea59e3d4cc58823c680029cc4c0
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr ""

